## 6. Definition of "done" (verification)

Objective checklist: `Maestro/checklists/definition-of-done.md` and
`Maestro/checklists/pre-merge.md`. Minimum summary before calling a change done:

- [ ] Build/syntax valid, without breaking what already exists.
- [ ] No errors in the affected flows (all relevant profiles/roles, if there is RBAC).
- [ ] Business rules and relationship integrity preserved (§5).
- [ ] Scoping/authorization preserved where applicable.
- [ ] Tests green — frontend and backend run **separately**, both must pass.
- [ ] `STATE.md` updated; `CHANGELOG.md` if it is a milestone.

